    "sections": {
        "description": "Yantra is a fast, modern multipurpose theme for businesses, blogs, portfolios and shops. Build the header and footer by dragging parts into rows, pick a color palette and a font pairing, and every choice shows live in the Customizer. Fluid type, a reading width for posts, card or list blogs, a sticky or see-through header, and block patterns for whole pages and landing pages. Keyboard and screen-reader friendly, ready for right-to-left languages and WooCommerce, and it makes no request to outside services unless you choose a Google font."
    },
